{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dungeon crawler creature collector RPG, sequel to the first <strong>Anode Heart</strong> game, set 300 years into the future, in a strange post-cataclysmic world. Sentient survivors now live outside of the virtual world established in the first game, on the surface called the\u00a0<strong>Real Plane</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[ ! ]</strong> <strong>This game can be played without any knowledge of previous AH installments, but it is recommended to play the first game before this one.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568570/extras/03de17300119eb74f04b86495a76ca22.poster.avif?t=1769533646\" width=256 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568570/extras/03de17300119eb74f04b86495a76ca22.webm?t=1769533646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as<strong> Code</strong>, a new member of the<strong> Pacifiers</strong>, trained sentients whose missions take place in the remnants of the<strong> Old Systems</strong>. As a<strong>\u00a0Pacifier</strong>, you'll be given a virtual companion creature known as<strong> Tama </strong>to fight alongside you. On your journey, you'll be able to befriend and tame many such creatures. You'll use their powers to descend deep down into the dungeons of the systems and to uncover their mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568570/extras/7a40ad36426765e258bcbb525474e4c0.poster.avif?t=1769533646\" width=256 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568570/extras/7a40ad36426765e258bcbb525474e4c0.webm?t=1769533646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ tameable creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creature collection album/dex</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast battling system, with a mix of turn based tactics and classic RPG monster tamer systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side-character recruiting system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ unique dungeon biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breeding</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568570/extras/e1d8ae9928732a86c60a75eb3b1095c1.apng?t=1769533646\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568570/extras/e1d8ae9928732a86c60a75eb3b1095c1.poster.avif?t=1769533646\" class=\"bb_img\" width=256 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My first concept for Anode Heart, back in early 2020, was actually a top-down shooter where you play as a &quot;pacifier&quot; who needs to descend down into the virtual systems, pacify bugged out creatures and rescue system-stuck sentients. I soon realized that a monster tamer game is something I'd enjoy playing and making a lot more, but the lore and the gritty setting of that first concept remained in the back of my mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I've wanted to do something with these ideas for a long time now, so I hope to bring this world into existence now, as part of the world of AH:2. See you all in the Sequel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sto</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568570?t=1769533646","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568570?t=1769533646","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568570/4b6efc9214a604616b6b22be5aa6d5adddac9fad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769533646","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568570/4b6efc9214a604616b6b22be5aa6d5adddac9fad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769533646","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dungeon crawler creature collector RPG, sequel to the first <strong>Anode Heart</strong> game, set 300 years into the future, in a strange post-cataclysmic world. Sentient survivors now live outside of the virtual world established in the first game, on the surface called the\u00a0<strong>Real Plane</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[ ! ]</strong> <strong>This game can be played without any knowledge of previous AH installments, but it is recommended to play the first game before this one.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568570/extras/03de17300119eb74f04b86495a76ca22.poster.avif?t=1769533646\" width=256 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568570/extras/03de17300119eb74f04b86495a76ca22.webm?t=1769533646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as<strong> Code</strong>, a new member of the<strong> Pacifiers</strong>, trained sentients whose missions take place in the remnants of the<strong> Old Systems</strong>. As a<strong>\u00a0Pacifier</strong>, you'll be given a virtual companion creature known as<strong> Tama </strong>to fight alongside you. On your journey, you'll be able to befriend and tame many such creatures. You'll use their powers to descend deep down into the dungeons of the systems and to uncover their mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568570/extras/7a40ad36426765e258bcbb525474e4c0.poster.avif?t=1769533646\" width=256 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568570/extras/7a40ad36426765e258bcbb525474e4c0.webm?t=1769533646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ tameable creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creature collection album/dex</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast battling system, with a mix of turn based tactics and classic RPG monster tamer systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side-character recruiting system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ unique dungeon biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breeding</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568570/extras/e1d8ae9928732a86c60a75eb3b1095c1.apng?t=1769533646\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568570/extras/e1d8ae9928732a86c60a75eb3b1095c1.poster.avif?t=1769533646\" class=\"bb_img\" width=256 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My first concept for Anode Heart, back in early 2020, was actually a top-down shooter where you play as a &quot;pacifier&quot; who needs to descend down into the virtual systems, pacify bugged out creatures and rescue system-stuck sentients. I soon realized that a monster tamer game is something I'd enjoy playing and making a lot more, but the lore and the gritty setting of that first concept remained in the back of my mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I've wanted to do something with these ideas for a long time now, so I hope to bring this world into existence now, as part of the world of AH:2. See you all in the Sequel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sto</p>","developers":["Stove Powered Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568570/5edf8b7e248c253b11d07a7be85b576b0c3541d4/header.jpg?t=1769533646","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3568570/851614/d7a33d624a98ad701e4bc8e85b7e42c75cd8fd51/1750468108/dash_av1.mpd?t=1742061578","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3568570/851614/d7a33d624a98ad701e4bc8e85b7e42c75cd8fd51/1750468108/dash_h264.mpd?t=1742061578","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3568570/851614/d7a33d624a98ad701e4bc8e85b7e42c75cd8fd51/1750468108/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1742061578","id":257114726,"name":"Anode Heart 2 preview","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257114726/61fab6ba02fdee2408b27e1baeefb0033aaadc3e/movie_600x337.jpg